ews/articles/cqj3d6xpk6d5o--350425dd4a32.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqj3d6xpk6d5o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Monger, who broke the Ironman record for a double amputee, urges the young to "chase their dreams".</summary></entry><entry><title>'All options' considered for Banksy's flag statue</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3vgy8pkykgxo#1</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:38:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-28T04:56:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3vgy8pkykgxo--0234c9a42e47.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3vgy8pkykgxo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Westminster City Council says it is the statue's custodian and is responsible for its safety.</summary></entry><entry><title>Boy, 7, sets up 'tiny gallery' of his artwork</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq5yj67gpk2ro#2</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T06:24:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq5yj67gpk2ro--2aa2761ec885.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq5yj67gpk2ro?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Max has curated his own miniature exhibition outside his Melton Mowbray home.</summary></entry><entry><title>The ladies who have lunched every month for 50 years</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck4glxl93y03o#2</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-26T06:50:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck4glxl93y03o--58f2fb9dab31.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck4glxl93y03o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The young mums who first met up in 1976 are now all in their 70s and 80s - but still best friends.</summary></entry><entry><title>Child's hidden letter found after 44 years</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqd08x91eympo#2</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T05:20:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqd08x91eympo--fb5225a3ce8f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqd08x91eympo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Michelle Harwood had not been born when the letter was written and did not expect to find the writer.</summary></entry><entry><title>What we know about RAF Fairford counter-terror probe</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c85ydnwqpzyzo#3</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T19:47:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c85ydnwqpzyzo--70431b485feb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c85ydnwqpzyzo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Five men have been arrested as counter-terror police lead an investigation into a major incident near the airbase.</summary></entry><entry><title>'I was angry at my husband - I didn't know he had dementia'</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckg59pnr8g78o#3</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T06:21:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckg59pnr8g78o--4f194afb78ee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckg59pnr8g78o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Helen Beaumont was told her husband was depressed. In fact he had young onset dementia.</summary></entry><entry><title>Being hit by a football in her face revealed my daughter's cancer</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvlylxlz39g9o#3</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T06:21:12Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvlylxlz39g9o--076828507288.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvlylxlz39g9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Aaron's daughter, Harper, was five years old when she was diagnosed with neuroblastoma.</summary></entry><entry><title>'I used to weigh 47 stone - now I'm a bodybuilder'</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqkgv3gzllexo#3</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T06:12:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqkgv3gzllexo--17b7d79650bf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqkgv3gzllexo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">At 25 years old, Jack Ako, weighed 47st (298kg), before embarking on his health and fitness journey.</summary></entry><entry><title>'Gaming pays me double what I earned as a teacher'</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwe8eje6zny7o#3</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T05:38:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwe8eje6zny7o--b295c8e3baea.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwe8eje6zny7o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Jarvs Tasker says it would have taken her 20 years as a teacher to make what she earns now.</summary></entry><entry><title>England win series as Banton delivers on potential</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/cricket/articles/cqrl6y38wez3o#5</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T16:49:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/sport/cricket/articles/cqrl6y38wez3o--93b5afa79cf2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/cricket/articles/cqrl6y38wez3o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Tom Banton delivers on all of his potential by crashing a brilliant first international century as England wrapped up their summer with an ODI series win over Sri Lanka.</summary></entry><entry><title>Saracens edge out Leicester despite Isiekwe red</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-union/articles/cmjrxg7xgn9wo#5</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T16:27:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-union/articles/cmjrxg7xgn9wo--3c312ff8a825.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-union/articles/cmjrxg7xgn9wo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Saracens overcome a second-half red card for Nick Isiekwe to begin the Brendan Venter era with a 40-38 win at Leicester Tigers.</summary></entry><entry><title>Heroic York rearguard stuns Wigan in Grand Final</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-league/articles/ck1wxy1nwq4zo#5</id><updated>2026-09-28T05:36:25Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T19:07:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-league/articles/ck1wxy1nwq4zo--b0affb9d284a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-league/articles/ck1wxy1nwq4zo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">York Valkyrie become the first side to win the Women's Super League three times after an incredible defensive effort thwarts favourites Wigan.</summary></entry></feed>
